            "review_title": "Review at Dim Tu Tac",
            "review_text": "Jason_Jeon\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nAuthentic dim sum, juicy flavors, friendly service, cozy for gatherings.\nOct 2024 • Family\ndelicious food for family great service to visit with friends I recommend to all\n\nA must-visit for authentic dim sum lovers! The juicy xiao long bao and tender har gow are perfectly crafted, melting in your mouth with every bite. Friendly service and a cozy ambiance make it ideal for gatherings with family or friends.\n\n정통 딤섬의 깊은 풍미와 신선한 재료가 돋보이는 맛집! 육즙 가득한 샤오롱바오와 부드러운 하가우는 입안에서 살살 녹습니다. 친절한 서비스와 아늑한 분위기로 가족, 친구와의 식사에 제격입니다.\nRead more\nWritten October 26, 2024",
