            "review_title": "Review at Dim Tu Tac",
            "review_text": "L Tran\nNew York City, New York1350 contributions\n1\nGood Chinese restaurant.\nApr 2024 • Friends\nThis restaurant is located on the 2nd floor of Tan Son Nhat hotel, quite away from general foot traffic. The menu is extensive with expected Chinese dishes. I liked the stuffed crab claws, sautéed asparagus, as well as roasted pigeons. The roasted suckling pig was just so so. The steamed fish was fresh. Since the restaurant focuses on fine dining, one should expect a higher price tag, but I think is reasonable for what it offers.\nRead more\nWritten May 1, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
