            "review_text": "TommyHK888\nGermany711 contributions\n0\nGood ambience at above-average prices\nApr 2023 • Friends\nThe restaurant can be reached via the entrance of the Tan Son Nhat Hotel. Take the elevator to the first floor and you'll be in front of the entrance. The restaurant has many round tables with seating for more than 10 people. The menu has a Cantonese influence. The food itself is beautifully presented, although the taste is rather average. The prices are very high by Vietnamese standards. I paid around 300 EUR for 10 people at lunchtime, without it being a big party. For me personally the price-performance ratio wasn't good, but for Asians the good location also counts.\nOne meal was enough for me.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten March 25, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
